  Occupation: Student
  CharacterDescription: "A typical teen girl with a harsh attitude. Studies hard
    to become a doctor. Has a mom, dad, and a sister; Sharena is her mom. She tries
    hard to gain her teacher and mom's love \u2014 an overachiever raised under a
    harsh mother. Has a special interest in human anatomy."
  CharacterArc: "When mutated, Miriam becomes fully nonverbal \u2014 creepy and deeply
    unsettling. She screams with an extremely disturbing voice if asked too many
    questions. She can manipulate the environment, moving, shattering, spotting,
    and opening things with startling speed. Physical mutations include a broken
    neck, black goop dripping from her face, and large tumorous hands."
